00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,901
Finally, uses.

2
00:00:01,901 --> 00:00:13,945
Ether is an excellent solvent for fats, oils, waxes and resins, and is used to extract organic compounds from water, because it is unreactive and boils off easily.

3
00:00:13,945 --> 00:00:16,875
Grignard reagents are made in dry ether.

4
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:22,773
The ether oxygen donates its lone pairs to the magnesium and keeps it in solution.

